"name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"qF8jkN4q4SajC4p4nKwjgQ","review_id":"P4pBlFxMWqlOmSLjZpBJpA","date":"2016-11-27T17:10:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9514638185501099,"text_excerpt":"After five days of eating Cajun/Creole style food, we felt we needed a break and looked for an Italian restaurant. Mona Lisa came up and it was a nice leisurely stroll from all the chaos that is on Bourbon. It's location is great! Nice and quiet. Friendly greeting when we walked up, and the owner had a table for us pretty quick, which was nice. The space is cozy. Our friendly waitress lived in San Diego at one time, so we talked a little bit about the area since she also lived in North Park. Good wine list! Tasty garlic bread! I ordered the spaghetti and meatballs. You get two uneven balls that are made with ground beef and pork (?), well, anyhow they were dense and meaty. Scooter had the..."},{"business_id":"qF8jkN4q4SajC4p4nKwjgQ","review_id":"rqcFee8NgYH3jRrMGHGJcg","date":"2020-05-15T23:02:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9466701149940491,"text_excerpt":"Mona Lisa is an amazing meal in the French Quarter service is friendly and i haven't had any dish i didn't like. The lasagna is delicious, the penne dish with Italians sausage is awesome! My wife and i love the DaVinci Pizza, and she raves about the spinach lasagna. We have been 4 or 5 times and have never been disappointed! Since the Covid shutdown, F (don't want to use his name) and the crew have kept our bellies full and our minds off the news with smiling service and takeout prompt and ready! My 9 year old wanted me to add the Mediterranean Salad is her favorite as well! Great spot, get there early to get a table, or just wait, it's worth it!"},{"business_id":"qF8jkN4q4SajC4p4nKwjgQ","review_id":"gn07tByf6yq3vw7T968EIg","date":"2011-01-18T18:24:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9458962082862854,"text_excerpt":"Mona Lisa is a great place, if you want good Italian food in the quarter, but you want to be kind of out of the \"thick\" of things. The place is small, but don't let that put you off. The food is delicious. I usually get the linguine alfredo (a favorite) with a glass of wine. The staff is extremely helpful and the cozy decor makes it great for dates. The tables are kind of small, but I like that and think it adds to the intimacy of the whole experience. I can't wait to go back!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"qF8jkN4q4SajC4p4nKwjgQ","photo_id":"5hPjWW2vfeW4P0w0hmf3Ng","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5hPjWW2vfeW4P0w0hmf3Ng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.86545330286026},{"business_id":"qF8jkN4q4SajC4p4nKwjgQ","photo_id":"2H7T9e1g3eo9rkuOplCZrQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2H7T9e1g3eo9rkuOplCZrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8626385927200317},{"business_id":"qF8jkN4q4SajC4p4nKwjgQ","photo_id":"uvgbxxu156Qnep-a5QHNDg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/uvgbxxu156Qnep-a5QHNDg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8598605394363403},{"business_id":"qF8jkN4q4SajC4p4nKwjgQ","photo_id":"T4M6BvBYriybCAKhSbC9yQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/T4M6BvBYriybCAKhSbC9yQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8407115936279297},{"business_id":"qF8jkN4q4SajC4p4nKwjgQ","photo_id":"uvUweHueUlSvpKf4HXxkXg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/uvUweHueUlSvpKf4HXxkXg.jpg","visual_representa